OL,3,GNEWSAPolice treat attack on man stabbed
OL,4,Amultiple times as attempted murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man in his 30s has been stabbed
OL,7,Fmultiple times in what the police are
OL,8,Ftreating as attempted murder.
OL,10,FDetectives believe two men were
OL,11,Finvolved in the attack in the greater
OL,12,FShantallow area of Londonderry on
OL,13,FTuesday night.
OL,15,FThe alert was raised shortly before
OL,16,F23:40 GMT after the victim flagged down
OL,17,Fa passing motorist on the Skeoge Link
OL,18,FRoad, who then called for help.
OL,20,FThe seriously injured man was treated
OL,21,Fat the scene by paramedics before being
OL,22,Ftaken to Altnagelvin hospital.
